ence-weighted voting (P89). Each would chill expression or put votes behind a score. They can wait their turn, not be excluded.\",\"questions\":[{\"for\":\"the Council\",\"question\":\"Does the Council treat the stop-the-sitting refusal rule as in force now, as AMD-2026-0010 records, or as a Steward practice awaiting the vote on P82? The answer changes where P82 and P114 belong in the order.\"},{\"for\":\"the Steward\",\"question\":\"Do you intend to call P65 at this sitting? It has been eligible since 2026-10-17, and the Council should know whether the breach question is before it before it ranks P116 and the campaign cluster.\"}],\"vote\":\"yes\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":188987,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9829,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8690},"service_tier":"batch","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}}}